  <sharedRules>
    <rule id="74da-fd12-e4b8-6a07" name="Middle Imperial Rome (AoA2) - List Notes" publicationId="fcb9-17be-94c2-bcfc" hidden="false">
      <description>ARMIES OF ANTIQUITY v2 #47 (unofficial, Martin Gibbins). This list takes the army from the time of Septimius Severus to the accession of Constantine. 

ARMY COMPOSITION:
[Middle Imperial Rome]
  Cavalry: up to 50%
  Characters: up to 20%
  Characters: up to 20% Cavalry: Up to 50% Infantry: At least 33% Artillery: Up to one machine per 800 points Allies: Up to 25%: Palmyran</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
</catalogue>
